\title{fluxCore package}
\description{
A scaffold for event-driven simulation projects in R. Provides a schema-based R6 Entity for mutable state with sparse history and an Engine for orchestrating simulations using pluggable ModelBundles loaded by ModelProviders (package, file, MLflow-friendly stubs). Supports non-uniform event times, event types, terminal events, and no-update events.
}
